    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d415">

                <pb facs="0603" n="483" sameAs="frus:frus1905/pg483"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The British Ambassador to the Secretary of
                    State.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >British Embassy</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1905-11-13"><hi rendition="#italic">November 13,
                        1905</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Dear Mr. Secretary</hi>: With reference to my letter
                    of November 4 on the subject of the preservation of Niagara Falls, I have the
                    honor to forward a copy of an approved minute of the privy council for
                    Canada.</p>
                <p>You will notice that it is stated that a report from the Joint Inter national
                    Waterways Commission on the subject may shortly be expected.</p>
                <p>Believe me, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">H. M. Durand.</hi></signed></closer>



                <xi:include href="d415-a1.xml" xpointer="d415-a1"/>
